:R-HSA-111367  a            owl:NamedIndividual , obo:GO_0008334 ;
        rdfs:comment        "This class of mRNAs is expressed from genes that lack introns yet the transcripts end in polyA tails. These tails are formed by a mechanism similar to that for pre-mRNAs containing introns. It is believed that there is a cis-element that replaces the 3' splice site that normally serves to activate polyadenylation of intron containing pre-mRNAs." ;
        rdfs:label          "SLBP independent Processing of Histone Pre-mRNAs" ;
